{
  "date": "2025-03-13",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오늘 날씨 너무좋다~",
      "en": "The weather is so nice today~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "요즘 날 점점 풀려서",
      "en": "The weather's been getting warmer lately,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "비록 날씨를 즐기진 못하고있지만",
      "en": "even though I haven't really been able to enjoy it,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좋다..",
      "en": "it's nice..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "촌캉스 넘재밌었지",
      "en": "The countryside getaway was so much fun."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 너무 행복했어",
      "en": "I was so happy."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 꿈같은 촌캉스 이후",
      "en": "But after that dream-like countryside getaway,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "바로 하루종일 연습하니까",
      "en": "I went straight back to practicing all day,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜",
      "en": "and honestly,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "음 꿈이였나",
      "en": "it almost felt like it was just a dream."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그만큼 재밌었어",
      "en": "That's how much fun it was."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "기대할만해",
      "en": "It's definitely something to look forward to."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "재밌었어",
      "en": "It was really fun."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어떻게 나올진 모르겠지만",
      "en": "I don't know how it'll turn out,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ 일단 우린 재밌었어",
      "en": "but seriously ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ we definitely had a great time."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "그럼 재밌겠지 뭐 정하연 나오면 재미 보장임",
      "en": "Then it'll definitely be fun. If Jeong HaYeon is in it, fun is guaranteed."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맞긴해",
      "en": "True."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "서핑부원도 모집하던데",
      "en": "They're recruiting members for the surfing club too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "서핑타러 와?",
      "en": "Want to come surfing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "서핑동아리는 수영복입고 가야해?",
      "en": "Do you have to wear a swimsuit to join the surfing club?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "당연하지",
      "en": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "레쉬가드에 레깅스",
      "en": "A rash guard and leggings."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "물안경이랑 수모없으면",
      "en": "If you don't have goggles and a swim cap,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "출입불가임",
      "en": "entry is prohibited."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "왜 포기함.",
      "en": "Why'd you give up already?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니면",
      "en": "Or..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "해녀복",
      "en": "wear a haenyeo suit."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "입어",
      "en": "Put one on."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "해녀복에",
      "en": "While wearing the haenyeo suit,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "망에 성게 3개 담아오면 ㅇㅈ드림",
      "en": "bring back three sea urchins in a net, and I'll 인정드림."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이도 그렇게 하면 저도 할게용!",
      "en": "If you do it too, then I'll do it!"
