      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㄹㅇ",
      "en": "For real."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이쁘다니까",
      "en": "I'm telling you, it's pretty."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "기대하고 있어봐",
      "en": "Just wait and look forward to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "까암짝 놀란다 그냥",
      "en": "You're just going to be completely surprised."
